{"id":23062,"name":"所见即我","rarity":5,"path":"Warrior","desc":"毁灭命途专属的光锥，光锥技能仅对该命途生效。","story":"财宝、权能、征服、挑战…冗杂片段在他的脑海中反复放映。\\n灯影摇曳的片刻，王将杯中事一饮而尽。\\n<i>「财宝充盈，土地无边，权能尽握，一切应得之物皆归于本王。」</i>\\n<i>「但仅是如此，人生又有什么意义？」</i>\\n\\n慵懒的身影躺进柔软的沙发，所思所想在瞬间消弭成云烟。\\n偶尔，王也需顺从自我的欲望，享受片刻欢愉。\\n<i>「所求所得有什么要紧，生命跃动随心的时刻，才是本王最钟爱的时刻。」</i>","max_promotion":6,"max_rank":5,"skill":{"id":23062,"name":"随心","desc":"使装备者的攻击力提高<color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>#1[i]%</unbreak></color>，能量恢复效率提高<color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>#2[f1]%</unbreak></color>。装备者施放终结技时，每消耗1点能量值，使本次造成的终结技伤害提高<color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>#3[f2]%</unbreak></color>，最多提高<color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>#6[i]%</unbreak></color>。装备者进入战斗或施放终结技时，使装备者获得【王之娱乐】，持续<unbreak>#4[i]</unbreak>回合。当装备者持有【王之娱乐】时，我方全体暴击伤害提高<color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>#5[i]%</unbreak></color>，同类效果无法叠加。","level":{"1":{"level":1,"param_list":[0.18,0.1,0.0019999999,3,0.24,0.72]},"2":{"level":2,"param_list":[0.21,0.125,0.0025000002,3,0.3,0.9]},"3":{"level":3,"param_list":[0.24,0.15,0.0029999998,3,0.36,1.08]},"4":{"level":4,"param_list":[0.27,0.175,0.0035,3,0.42,1.26]},"5":{"level":5,"param_list":[0.3,0.2,0.0039999997,3,0.48,1.44]}}},"stats":{"0":{"hp_base":43.2,"hp_add":6.48,"attack_base":28.8,"attack_add":4.32,"defence_base":21,"defence_add":3.15,"max_level":20,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":5000},{"ItemID":111001,"ItemNum":8}]},"1":{"hp_base":95.04,"hp_add":6.48,"attack_base":63.36,"attack_add":4.32,"defence_base":46.2,"defence_add":3.15,"max_level":30,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":10000},{"ItemID":110281,"ItemNum":4},{"ItemID":111001,"ItemNum":12}]},"2":{"hp_base":164.16,"hp_add":6.48,"attack_base":109.44,"attack_add":4.32,"defence_base":79.8,"defence_add":3.15,"max_level":40,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":20000},{"ItemID":110282,"ItemNum":4},{"ItemID":111002,"ItemNum":8}]},"3":{"hp_base":233.28,"hp_add":6.48,"attack_base":155.52,"attack_add":4.32,"defence_base":113.4,"defence_add":3.15,"max_level":50,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":50000},{"ItemID":110282,"ItemNum":8},{"ItemID":111002,"ItemNum":12}]}